Subject: [PATCH 6.12.y 1/3] drm/xe/guc_ads: allocate UM queues in a separate BO
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 03:41:11 +0000
Message-ID: <20260825034113.642528-1-jia.yao@intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.43.0
In-Reply-To: <2026082037-mutual-coroner-efeb@gregkh>
References: <2026082037-mutual-coroner-efeb@gregkh>
